  "categoryName": "Audiencias y desarrollo del juicio",
  "motif": "Exhibición de documento",
  "treatment": "contrast",
  "family": "paired-comparison",
  "description": "Two identical generic hearing rooms. At the same moment one supplied difference is introduced at the zone's place on the board: in B a ◆ marks that a detail is selected, in A the place stays plain. The same action then runs in both rooms: the presenter points and the document settles on the board with its reference (● complete document); only in B is a region framed and an enlarged copy of it (lines and blocks only) grown into the zone (◆ selected detail), while in A the zone stays empty. A guide links the two places. No winner, score, authenticity, admissibility, weight or ruling.",
